Package: com.moxuan.fontchange
Name: FontChange
Version: 2.3.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Reuses the active RootHide font mount when available, falls back to FontChange's built-in mount, refreshes language caches, restores system fonts, and reboots userspace.
Maintainer: moxuan1121
Author: moxuan1121
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), unzip
